{
  "_doc": "How the connection checks of bim.props.check judge an element by its trade (Q6505): which equipment takes a power circuit, and which systems are fire protection. Words are matched at word starts in the element's type, type mark, model, name, description, tag and build part (lower case; '_' ':' '-' '/' read as spaces). When phrases of both lists match, the longest phrase decides.",
